| Q4 Provable non-invasively? | **PARTIAL** — GET-based evidence (200 vs prod FORBIDDEN) confirms missing guard; full proof requires POST mutation returning actual code (HUMAN_ONLY) |
| Q5 Novel/unreported? | **YES** — testing-only mutation left accessible on staging with prod-parity schema; no prior report |
| Q6 Not always-rejected? | **YES** — staging env confusion is an accepted finding class in LEARN entries |
| Q7 Reasonable triager? | **HOLD** — evidence is compelling (8-cycle persistence, env-parity proven) but final proof requires POST demonstrating code extraction → ATO chain |

**Verdict: HOLD**

**Reason:** Structural proof strong but POST code-extraction (HUMAN_ONLY) needed for full ATO chain demonstration.

