## Important Details
- **Harness defect (blocking automated verification):** `.github/workflows/hunt.yml:207-225` — URL regex excludes whitespace/`"`/`)`/`]`/`}` but **not** backtick (and `strip('.,;)]}>')` omits backtick) → probe URLs capture a trailing backtick → HTTP 400. `User-Agent` includes `(passive verifier)` suffix → Cloudflare 403 bot-gate. `urls[:12]` truncates candidate coverage. `probe-results.md` (1192 lines, last 2026-10-03 13:32:52 UTC) has **ZERO POST GraphQL probes** and contains malformed-brace/403/400 artifacts; all structural findings were derived from manual `curl` (balanced URL-encoded GET) and must not be inferred from the automated log alone.
- **Knowledge base state:** `knowledge/index.md` contains a `## CANONICAL STATUS (2026-09-30)` partitioning LIVE/DEAD/SURVIVING/METHOD RULES to prevent re-resurrection of falsified claims. Multiple historical KB lines (name-only mutation arg enumeration) were corrected to argument-type/read depth errors (CVSS 5.3→7.5 context recorded).
