impact: An attacker who can serve script on, or otherwise control, the staging origin can issue credentialed cross-origin reads and writes (POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE all allowed) against the production GraphQL API in a victim's browser, riding that victim's session. Escalates to cross-environment privilege and vertical privilege escalation once combined with mass assignment.
