## Objective
- Continue the Cineplex Deutschland GmbH & Co. KG bug bounty hunt (report channel: `bugs.olivermaicher.eu`). Prioritize high-value logic flaws in scoped assets (GraphQL, CORS with credentialed reflection, IDOR/BOLA with chaining, mass assignment, auth/session, subdomain takeover). Enforce the program's explicit out-of-scope exclusions and separate verified facts from harness artifacts.

## Important Details
- **Harness defect (critical):** The retired inline passive verifier is untrustworthy. It emits a literal trailing backtick in probe URLs (→ HTTP 400), uses a `Mozilla/5.0 (passive verifier)` UA that hits the Cloudflare WAF bot-gate (→ HTTP 403), truncates URLs (`urls[:12]`), and had brace-truncation causing false-negative 400s on GraphQL. `probe-results.md` is ~1154 lines with **ZERO POST GraphQL probes** across all recorded cycles. All live GraphQL/IDOR/CORS evidence in this hunt rests on **manual `curl` with `--http2` and a browser UA** (balanced, URL-encoded `?query=…`). Do **not** infer endpoint state from automated 403/400s.
- **GraphQL surface:** `graphql-api.app.cineplex.de` and `graphql-api.app.staging.cineplex.de` expose GraphQL on **`/`** and **`/graphql`** (and GET mirrors `/api/graphql`, `/gql` exist but POST/OPTIONS to mirrors often blocked by API Gateway). The schema is served under **any unshadowed path** (catch-all). Unauthenticated introspection confirmed: prod **83 query fields + 140 mutation fields**, staging **83 query fields** with identical names; **44 INPUT_OBJECT types**, **385 types total**. Dangerous input shapes exist (`login.privileged`, `startWebBooking.freeTicketSpend/linkedUsersIds`, `logUserScreeningInterests.freeTicketSpend/linkedUserIds`, `sendNotifications(authToken,userIds)`, `deleteCineplexUser(id,apiKey)`, `CinemaOperatingCompanyData.accessRight*`, `updateUser(adminCinemaOperatingCompanyIds)`, `increaseUserTestingStatus`, `loginPOS(authToken:String!)`, `refreshLogin(privileged:Boolean)`, `updatePassword` nullable-credential deprecated). `staging/graphql` parity restored to 200 (was 500). `getOnlineTicketingBooking` is root-gated (`FORBIDDEN "You must be the root user"`).
- **CORS:** On `graphql-api.app.cineplex.de` (prod) the global CORS allowlist reflects **`http://localhost:3000`**, **`https://app.staging.cineplex.de`**, and **`null`** with `access-control-allow-credentials: true` on actual responses. `OPTIONS /` returns **204** with reflected `Access-Control-Allow-Origin`, `Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true`, `Access-Control-Allow-Methods` including `POST`, and `Access-Control-Allow-Headers: content-type,authorization`. Disallowed origins throw HTTP 500 (`Error: Not allowed by CORS` at `/var/task/graphql.js:47459:17`). The allowlist matches origins **ending with `cineplex.de`** (label-boundary verified by controls: `evilcineplex.de`/`notcineplex.de`/`a.evilcineplex.de` → 500, `attacker.cineplex.de`/`sub.attacker.cineplex.de` reflect with ACAC:true). This is a credentialed-preflight primitive (HUMAN_ONLY/browser-based exploitation assessment required).
- **IDOR / decoder oracle:** Four single-entity resolvers (`userById`, `invoice`, `order`, `ticket`) **decode-before-auth** (return `INVALID_ID` with `decodePublicId` stacktrace, no Authorization header). Chaining: `ticket(id)→order→user` and `order(id)→user` reach the same **User (51 fields)** including `onlineTicketingToken`, `inviteCode`, `linkedAccounts`, and financial history **without calling `userById`**. `userByQr(qrCode)` also returns `User` (physical→digital profile). Control group: 6/6 sibling gates fire (`currentUser`, `searchUsers` ROLE-gated, `adminUsers` ROOT-gated, `userByQr` DEVICE-gated, `voucherInstanceByQR`, `errorStatistics`) proving auth is omitted only on the id-decode family. **Decoder oracle exists; authorization omission not conclusively demonstrated by `INVALID_ID` alone. Cross-tenant PII proof is HUMAN_ONLY.**
- **Mass assignment / auth primitives:** `CinemaOperatingCompanyData.accessRightDashboard/FilmStatistics/BonusProgram/Campaigning` are caller-supplied and mirror `UserPrivileges.accessRight*`. `updateUser(adminCinemaOperatingCompanyIds)` mirrors privilege scope. `increaseUserTestingStatus` (enum includes `TESTING|PRODUCTION|STAGING|DEVELOPMENT|CINEMA_EMPLOYEE`). `login(privileged:Boolean)`, `refreshLogin(privileged:Boolean)`, `loginPOS(authToken:String!)`. `updatePassword` deprecated with **both** credential arguments nullable. `SDKLoginInput.cookieId+userId`, `ConsentInput.cookieId`, `logItems` (caller-controlled), `editUserGroupFilter(id, …)` — schema-level write surfaces (not executed).
- **Dangling CNAME / dev origins:** `web-dev.cineplex.de` CNAMEs to `web.gentleglacier-….switzerlandnorth.azurecontainerapps.io` with A-follow **NXDOMAIN + Azure SOA** for 17+ consecutive cycles — sole dangle in 14-host sweep; DoH machine-checkable (pipeline header fixed). `buchung-dev.cineplex.de` and `bms-dev.cineplex.de` point to `194.77.169.121` (direct origin, no Cloudflare) — oscillate between TCP-reachable (SPAs 200, `/gateway/*` often 503 “Wartungsarbeiten”) and 000 timeouts; network-gated, not dead. Prod booking/shop on different origin (404 default-backend). `dev.cineplex.de` A `10.20.0.7` (RFC1918) — info-only.
- **Relay / infra:** `data-9fc27eb430.cineplex.de` returns `/health` 200 and `/metrics` 200 (IOMB broker counters: queue_capacity 30000, messages_queued ~0.9e9+ over cycles). Descriptive telemetry only — **not reportable alone**. Relay broker saturation **REJECTED** (no exploitable unauthenticated manipulation path).
- **Out of scope / dead:** `api.cineplex.de` WAF strictly blocks GraphQL (all methods/encodings) — GET-bypass hypothesis dead. TLS-dead: `app.staging.cineplex.de`, `graphql-api.app.couat.cineplex.de`, `login.cineplex.de`, `sso.cineplex.de` (SSLv3/525). `auth.cineplex.de/.well-known/jwks.json` and OIDC discovery 404 — passive JWKS path closed. Program exclusions: username_enumeration, ssl_tls_best_practices, csrf_logout, descriptive_errors, known_vuln_library, OAuth/JWKS passive paths. Nextcloud/analytics/mailing/profil misc items mostly REJECTED or PARKED (low confidence/value).
- **Publisher/tooling state:** `scripts/passive_verify.py` replaced inline verifier (14 offline tests). `scripts/sync-issues.py` publisher: 1109 [HYP]→59 fingerprints after suppression; near-duplicate collapse + label creation fixed. Falsified `class:IDOR` blocks purged from publish path (297→0); decoder oracle retained as `class:ACCESS_CONTROL`. `knowledge/index.md` has canonical `## CANONICAL STATUS (2026-09-30)` above history to prevent resurrection of retracted claims.

