## Objective
- Continue read-only bug bounty hunting against in-scope `cineplex.de` assets with focus on GraphQL (`graphql-api.app.cineplex.de`, `graphql-api.app.staging.cineplex.de`), CORS, IDOR/chaining, mass-assignment, and the `web-dev.cineplex.de` dangling CNAME.

## Important Details
- **Scope:** Only in-scope Cineplex Deutschland assets per `scope.yml` + `inventory/cineplex.md`. 
- **Rules:** read-only GET/HEAD/OPTIONS/DNS, <= 1 rps. No mutations, no PII retrieval, no account/customer data touched. HUMAN_ONLY for cross-tenant IDOR proof and staging POST oracle.
- **GraphQL surface:** `graphql-api.app.cineplex.de` and `graphql-api.app.staging.cineplex.de` expose full unauthenticated schema (83 queries / 140 mutations) on `/` and `/graphql`. Any unshadowed path serves `__typename` (arbitrary-path catchall). 
- **CORS:** Production reflects `http://localhost:3000`, `https://app.staging.cineplex.de` and `null` with `Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true`. `OPTIONS /` returns 204 with `ACAO` reflected, `ACAM: GET,HEAD,PUT,PATCH,POST,DELETE`, `ACAH: content-type,authorization`. Root `/` is the only POST-capable GraphQL route; `/graphql`, `/api/graphql`, `/gql` are GET-only mirrors (API-GW 403 on POST/OPTIONS).
- **IDOR/Chaining:** `userById`, `invoice`, `order`, `ticket` decode-before-gate. `ticket(id)->order->user` and `order(id)->user` reach the same 51-field `User` (incl. `onlineTicketingToken`, `inviteCode`, `linkedAccounts`, financial history) without `userById`. `userByQr(qrCode)` returns `User` (physical->profile).
- **Mass-assignment:** `CinemaOperatingCompanyData.accessRightDashboard/FilmStatistics/BonusProgram/Campaigning` mirror `UserPrivileges`. `updateUser(adminCinemaOperatingCompanyIds)`, `increaseUserTestingStatus`, `login(privileged:Boolean)`, `refreshLogin(privileged:Boolean)`, `loginPOS(authToken:String!)`, `sendNotifications(authToken, userIds)`, `deleteCineplexUser(id,apiKey)` are input-controlled.
- **Dev/infra:** `web-dev.cineplex.de` CNAME -> `web.gentleglacier-dfef6458.switzerlandnorth.azurecontainerapps.io` with A-follow NXDOMAIN + Azure SOA (dangling takeover precondition). `buchung-dev.cineplex.de` / `bms-dev.cineplex.de` on `194.77.169.121` (direct origin). `data-9fc27eb430.cineplex.de/metrics` is descriptive IOMB telemetry only.
- **Harness:** `probe-results.md` is untrustworthy (trailing backtick, `urllib` UA hits Cloudflare bot-gate, brace truncation). All live confirmations use balanced URL-encoded `curl --http2` with browser UA. Verifier replaced by `scripts/passive_verify.py` (14 offline tests).
- **Known dead/OOS:** `api.cineplex.de` strict WAF 403; `login.cineplex.de`, `sso.cineplex.de`, `app.staging.cineplex.de`, `graphql-api.app.couat.cineplex.de` TLS-dead; relay saturation/metrics rejected as descriptive-only; username enumeration/ssl/csrf/descriptive-errors/known-vuln excluded.

