- Explicit out-of-scope (REJECTED classes): username enumeration, SSL/TLS best practices/attacks, CSRF on logout, descriptive errors/headers, known-vulnerable library, OAuth/JWKS passive paths, OPTIONS/TRACE as a finding, mail config, brute-force/rate-limit policy, plus program note barring exposure of customer/financial/auth data during testing.
