## Objective
- Act as a senior bug bounty analyst for the Cineplex Deutschland program (report channel: bugs.olivermaicher.eu), running a 7-step structured hunt cycle (DELTA → PRIORITIZE → HYPOTHESES → SELF-CRITIQUE → NEXT → LEARN → RISK) on scoped assets only.
- Maintain and correct a large append-only knowledge base while avoiding repeated self-inflicted errors (evidence-depth errors, harness-derived conclusions, resurrected falsified claims).

## Important Details
- Scope: only Cineplex-owned infra/domains per scope.yml + inventory/cineplex.md; read-only probes only, ≤1 rps, GET/HEAD/OPTIONS; no PII/customer-data access, no mutating tests.
- REJECTED classes (never report): username_enumeration, ssl_tls_best_practices, csrf_logout, descriptive_errors, known_vuln_library, OAuth/JWKS-passive, relay_metrics/relay_broker_saturation, api_cineplex_get_bypass, TLS-dead hosts (app.staging, graphql-api.app.couat, login, sso — SSLv3/525), relay IOMB stats, staging_testing_oracle (rejected as standalone — descriptive method-mismatch error).
- Key live findings (ACCEPTED): CORS label-boundary suffix allowlist with ACAC:true on graphql-api.app.{,staging.}cineplex.de (`*.cineplex.de` origins + localhost + `Origin:null` reflected; evilcineplex.de → 500); OPTIONS / → 204 with ACAAM `GET,HEAD,PUT,PATCH,POST,DELETE` (no OPTIONS entry), ACAH `content-type,authorization`; arbitrary-path GraphQL catch-all (any unshadowed path serves schema); dangling CNAME takeover precondition on web-dev.cineplex.de (CNAME → web.gentleglacier-dfef6458.switzerlandnorth.azurecontainerapps.io, A-follow NXDOMAIN, 17+ cycles, PASSIVE, claimability provider-side); CORS chain dangle→credentialed read.
- Key retractions: idor_ownership_omission falsified (INVALID_ID-vs-UNAUTHENTICATED measures decode position, not check presence — decoder oracle only, class:ACCESS_CONTROL fingerprint 4ad65631f720); "4 equivalent surfaces" claim wrong; "remediation scope 2 paths × 2 envs" wrong (catch-all means path-pattern × 2 envs); cors_lookalike_registrable_domain rejected; UserPrivileges is OBJECT not input object.
- Harness defects (8 fixed in .github/workflows/hunt.yml:207-225): backtick in URL regex → 400; UA "(passive verifier)" → 403 bot-gate; urls[:12] truncation; brace truncation → false 400. Probe-results.md results are void; all conclusions rest on manual balanced curl (`curl -G --data-urlencode`, browser UA, `--http2`).
- Publisher (scripts/sync-issues.py): parse_blocks matches `^\[HYP]` only; falsified IDOR blocks cleaned (class:IDOR 297→0); web-dev dangle still fragmented into ~5 blocks with divergent class labels (MISCONFIG/OTHER/SUBDOMAIN_TAKEOVER) — lead-authoring debt, not to auto-merge; 2 malformed `class: 'MISCONFIG' CONF: '93'` lines.
- Method rules: a type is not read until its field list is in hand; method-vary every equivalence claim; never infer absence from automated-log silence; scope evidence to blast radius before asserting system properties; corrections need a position that outranking the claim.
