- Current state: `{"phase": "POC", "target": "api"}` — refine and verify the surviving findings on `graphql-api.app.cineplex.de`.

## Important Details
- Scope: only Cineplex-owned assets (scope.yml + inventory/cineplex.md, 132-host baseline, CT + CNAME sweep exhausted → breadth dead; leverage is depth on `graphql-api.app.cineplex.de`).
- Explicitly OUT of scope: username_enumeration, ssl_tls_best_practices, csrf_logout, descriptive_errors, known_vuln_library, OAuth/JWKS passive paths, relay_metrics/relay_broker_saturation, api.cineplex.de GET-bypass (dead), TLS-dead hosts (app.staging, graphql-api.app.couat, login, sso).
- Live probes: read-only, ≤1 rps, GET/HEAD/OPTIONS only; passive-first; no mutating tests on live customer data; PII cross-tenant proof is HUMAN_ONLY.
- Manual curl is the trusted evidence source: `curl -sS --http2 -A "Mozilla/5.0"` with `-G --data-urlencode 'query=...'`; automated `probe-results.md` (1330 lines, ZERO POST ever) is VOID — retired inline verifier at `.github/workflows/hunt.yml:207-225` had 8 defects (backtick in URL → 400, `(passive verifier)` UA → 403, brace truncation, globs matching nothing, urls[:12] truncation). Replacement: `scripts/passive_verify.py` (14 offline tests, `scripts/test_passive_verify.py`).
